lers left.","sources":["https://youtu.be/XSPJL_mlFXo?t=134","stats"]},{"field":"gp","text":"Yahoo's 57 already includes sitting back-to-backs (Dallas has 16) and his long knee history, so it is kept.","sources":["https://youtu.be/XSPJL_mlFXo?t=647","https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=959"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"Dallas has no reason to tank, but a 34-year-old with knee history on a fringe team may get a rest night in March.","sources":["https://youtu.be/sfCe7fS9daM?t=1644","https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=959"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}